  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.583740234375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Studies in which the primary intervention was decentralization chiefly assessed diagnosis or case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        79.31470489501953,
        527.4185180664062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(139–154) (59, 145, 155) notification outcomes (n=16)  , with fewer assessing TPT outcomes (n=3)  . In",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3447265625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "general, interventions that included both strengthening of diagnostic capacity in primary care settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9738187789917,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4389038085938,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "and strengthening links between communities and facilities consistently showed an increase in case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4277954101562,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "notifications and TPT initiations, while interventions that involved only community-based activities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        109.23408508300781,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "did not.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        153.81861877441406,
        527.4977416992188,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "(156, 157) Two studies of service integration were identified   as showing limited impact on case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.4619140625,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "notifications of screening in IMCI clinics or co-location of TB and ART services. The two studies of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.21864318847656,
        527.5462646484375,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "(158, 159) family-centred care   showed that the provision of socioeconomic support packages to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        452.6201477050781,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "families affected by TB was associated with increased TPT initiation and completion.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.4168701171875,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "The reviewers noted that, while substantial wider literature on integration and family-centred care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4102172851562,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "is available, evidence for the specific impact on child and adolescent TB outcomes is limited. Some",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.1832885742188,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "overlap was noted between the integration of TB services into non-specialized settings such as general",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956162452697754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.3046264648438,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "outpatient or primary care services or decentralization. This was a slightly artificial separation for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        524.3841552734375,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "the evidence review since in practice decentralization and integration into PHC may occur together.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.04248046875,
        184.902099609375,
        315.7024841308594
      ],
      "text": "GDG considerations:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.910400390625,
        527.5006103515625,
        337.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "With regard to the evidence reviewed on the impact of decentralization on TB case detection, the GDG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957718849182129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.83441162109375,
        527.3936157226562,
        350.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "(148, 150)  observed that two trials  and one observational study of home-based screening (without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.0343933105469,
        527.4966430664062,
        363.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "(153) facility-based strengthening)   had fewer diagnoses or notifications among children aged below 15",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.957818984985352,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.5104064941406,
        527.549072265625,
        376.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "years in the intervention group compared to the control group, but that none of these differences were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95139217376709,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.7104187011719,
        527.3892211914062,
        390.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "statistically significant. The GDG considered that, while there may be a reduction in case notifications",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        388.910400390625,
        527.4201049804688,
        403.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "at higher levels of care, TB detection may improve if children are seen by a competent clinician at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.11041259765625,
        527.5094604492188,
        416.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "the first point of access (such as at PHC level). The evidence overall was recognized as uncertain. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996349334716797,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.3103942871094,
        527.4135131835938,
        429.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "benefit of increased case-finding and an increased number of children with TB who are initiated on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.5104064941406,
        527.4344482421875,
        442.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "TB treatment was considered to outweigh the concern for overtreatment. Therefore, the undesirable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.7104187011719,
        527.3968505859375,
        456.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "effects of case detection were considered trivial. The GDG discussed the potential risks of provision",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.910400390625,
        527.407958984375,
        469.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "and management of TPT at the peripheral level, including undetected drug-related adverse events",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.11041259765625,
        527.4036865234375,
        482.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "such as hepatotoxicity and insufficient capacity to manage these events. In addition, there may be a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.3103942871094,
        527.4212646484375,
        495.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "risk of TB disease being treated with a course of TPT rather than with a complete treatment regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.5104064941406,
        527.2716674804688,
        508.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "All these undesirable events can potentially happen but were considered rare and not of major",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.71044921875,
        527.14111328125,
        522.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "concern. Therefore, the undesirable effects for TPT provision were also considered trivial. Overall, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995048522949219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.910400390625,
        527.5424194335938,
        535.3533935546875
      ],
      "text": "GDG agreed that the balance of desirable and undesirable effects probably favours decentralized TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999249458312988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.1104125976562,
        527.4013671875,
        548.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "services for case detection and provision of TPT to children and adolescents. The panel noted that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.3104248046875,
        516.6092529296875,
        561.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "differences in the setting and the availability of adequate resources are important considerations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.014404296875,
        527.4267578125,
        583.4573974609375
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also discussed the fact that family-centred, integrated care includes interventions at the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        582.2142944335938,
        527.417724609375,
        596.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "household level to identify members of the household who require evaluation for TB disease, TPT,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.4144287109375,
        527.4366455078125,
        609.857421875
      ],
      "text": "treatment support etc. Some overlap between the integration of TB services into non-specialized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.6143798828125,
        527.2902221679688,
        623.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "settings – such as general outpatient or primary care services and decentralization – was noted.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.8143920898438,
        527.5208740234375,
        636.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "However, this was considered to be a somewhat artificial separation since in practice decentralization",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992847442626953,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.0142822265625,
        527.6136474609375,
        649.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "and integration into PHC may occur at the same time. Overall, despite a lack of evidence on undesirable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.2142944335938,
        524.5083618164062,
        662.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "effects and low quality of the data, the panel agreed that there is evidence of positive effects of family-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973067283630371,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.4144287109375,
        527.3848266601562,
        675.857421875
      ],
      "text": "centred integrated care. It was suggested that family-centred, integrated care could be an addition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.6143798828125,
        527.4586181640625,
        689.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "to both the standard of care and specialized services which do not have an integration component.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.8143920898438,
        527.4344482421875,
        702.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "Family-centred care (in the sense of family involvement) was highlighted as a core principle of child",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.0142822265625,
        123.88939666748047,
        715.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "health care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        722.7183227539062,
        527.4574584960938,
        737.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that setting-specific factors related to the TB burden or the organization of health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        735.9183349609375,
        527.3837280273438,
        750.361328125
      ],
      "text": "services may have an impact on feasibility, acceptability and equity. GDG members also pointed out",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.1182861328125,
        527.1500244140625,
        763.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "that the initial health system costs for establishing decentralized and family-centred, integrated services",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.948579788208008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323.2414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 Tuberculosis care and support: Recommendations 195",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
